WEBVTT

00:27:59.156 --> 00:28:03.156
you want just one nugget of information,
that if you missed everything,

00:28:03.156 --> 00:28:06.916
what is the one thing that you want
everyone to walk away from,

00:28:06.956 --> 00:28:08.596
at the end of this conversation?

00:28:10.316 --> 00:28:14.836
RW: That if you want to make
one choice today

00:28:14.876 --> 00:28:18.156
that will make you healthier and happier,

00:28:18.196 --> 00:28:23.036
it is to pay attention to improving
your connections with other people.

00:28:23.076 --> 00:28:28.476
That that is such a good investment,
and it will pay off for years to come.

00:28:28.996 --> 00:28:31.476
[Want to support TED?]